WEBVTT

00:00:44.503 --> 00:00:46.421
Princess! Princess!

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.969
IN SURGERY

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:27.856
Eye of the Tiger

00:02:32.944 --> 00:02:34.071
Vital signs?

00:02:34.321 --> 00:02:35.781
They're low,

00:02:35.947 --> 00:02:37.532
-but stable.
-Good.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:40.160
<i>The princess? What's her condition?</i>

00:02:40.702 --> 00:02:43.538
<i>She's not out of the woods yet.</i>
<i>What about Doug?</i>

00:02:44.122 --> 00:02:45.374
I lost him.

00:02:45.457 --> 00:02:46.667
<i>You're kidding!</i>

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:48.251
<i>What were you doing?</i>

00:02:48.418 --> 00:02:49.711
Don't yell at me.

00:02:50.212 --> 00:02:52.881
Doug attacked me.
I'm doing repairs now.

00:02:52.964 --> 00:02:54.883
I'll keep searching once I'm finished.

00:02:56.093 --> 00:02:57.094
Got it.

00:02:58.095 --> 00:02:59.763
Head for the West bank!

00:03:06.812 --> 00:03:09.689
Did you hear that?
Head for the West bank block.

00:03:16.279 --> 00:03:18.532
Where the heck is he?

00:03:19.741 --> 00:03:22.452
Hey, Leon,
why don't you get changed first?

00:03:22.953 --> 00:03:24.454
The princess was shot!

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:32.170
I'm sorry for raising my voice.

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:38.135
Jay gave me access to all
the surveillance cameras in the city.

00:03:41.138 --> 00:03:44.224
I have to find him... Find Doug.

00:03:44.933 --> 00:03:47.561
I don't have time to change clothes.

00:03:47.978 --> 00:03:48.979
Leon...

00:03:49.938 --> 00:03:52.065
Damn it! This is so frustrating!

00:03:55.944 --> 00:03:57.904
Charge at 200! Stand back!

00:04:04.244 --> 00:04:06.079
You didn't finish off the target?

00:04:06.163 --> 00:04:07.080
Who's there?

00:04:09.249 --> 00:04:11.918
Well, it sure ain't Cleopatra.

00:04:13.503 --> 00:04:16.089
And I'm no Mark Antony either.

00:04:18.175 --> 00:04:20.510
My information was useful, wasn't it?

00:04:20.594 --> 00:04:22.220
This hideout, too.

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:24.598
Yeah.

00:04:25.056 --> 00:04:28.769
Well, it's no four-star hotel suite.

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:32.773
But for an extra fee, I can throw in
some tropical background music.

00:04:33.148 --> 00:04:36.109
The sound of the rain
is music enough for me.

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:43.533
As usual, in a secure account.

00:04:43.867 --> 00:04:45.076
Pleasure doing business.

00:04:53.794 --> 00:04:55.295
Any word from Leon?

00:04:55.378 --> 00:04:56.546
Not yet.

00:04:56.713 --> 00:05:00.884
At any rate, we won't find him
just running around town.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:03.970
We just have to wait, then.

00:05:08.308 --> 00:05:11.061
So, what is this Eye of the Tiger?

00:05:12.479 --> 00:05:14.773
You mentioned it to the brainiac
at the restaurant.

00:05:19.027 --> 00:05:22.072
He's a sniper whose specialty
is assassinating VIPs.

00:05:22.864 --> 00:05:26.493
That's what he was called
among terrorist groups.

00:05:45.929 --> 00:05:48.348
No! Get back inside! You'll die!

00:06:01.444 --> 00:06:04.030
<i>He let me live.</i>

00:06:04.781 --> 00:06:06.908
<i>He could have easily killed me.</i>

00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:10.328
<i>Seeing as he killed his target</i>
<i>with a single shot.</i>

00:06:11.705 --> 00:06:15.292
So, why didn't he kill the princess
with a single shot?

00:06:16.543 --> 00:06:18.128
Hold on a minute.

00:06:18.295 --> 00:06:20.422
Now I'm a little confused.

00:06:21.798 --> 00:06:25.885
You think the Eye of the Tiger
is responsible for this, right, commander?

00:06:26.261 --> 00:06:27.887
At least that's what I thought.

00:06:29.514 --> 00:06:33.018
So, you believe that Doug
is this Eye of the Tiger?

00:06:33.476 --> 00:06:35.270
Yes. No doubt about it.

00:06:36.396 --> 00:06:40.150
Queenie spotted Doug when he
was at his sniper position.

00:06:40.609 --> 00:06:41.693
Yeah.

00:06:43.278 --> 00:06:45.864
Then who cares if he's
the Eye of the Tiger or not.

00:06:46.114 --> 00:06:47.741
Doug is the culprit, right?

00:06:48.241 --> 00:06:51.620
That's the problem!
I'm just as confused as you are!

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:56.458
If he's the Eye of the Tiger,
then no matter the situation,

00:06:56.541 --> 00:06:58.585
he would've killed her
with a single shot.

00:07:00.086 --> 00:07:01.755
And yet the Princess...

00:07:03.256 --> 00:07:05.342
There's no reason to overthink it.

00:07:05.634 --> 00:07:07.594
Doug is the culprit, so we arrest him.

00:07:07.927 --> 00:07:09.346
Isn't that enough?

00:07:10.305 --> 00:07:11.640
I'm returning to the base.

00:07:12.974 --> 00:07:16.102
At times like this, all we can do is
start over from scratch.

00:07:17.103 --> 00:07:19.522
Just in case, deploy with your MOEV.

00:07:20.899 --> 00:07:22.192
Hey, wait!

00:07:23.109 --> 00:07:24.152
There he is!

00:07:24.235 --> 00:07:26.446
<i>Doug is near</i>
<i>Xianglong First Medical Center.</i>

00:07:27.155 --> 00:07:29.449
He's two blocks south from you, Queenie!

00:07:57.936 --> 00:08:01.231
Don't worry. The surgery was successful.

00:08:05.485 --> 00:08:06.861
Don't speak for now.

00:08:07.112 --> 00:08:09.531
This isn't the first time
you've been shot.

00:08:14.119 --> 00:08:15.495
Please rest, Princess!

00:08:27.882 --> 00:08:29.634
As if I'd shoot you.

00:08:29.718 --> 00:08:31.761
I'm a feminist, after all.

00:08:34.264 --> 00:08:37.142
Don't regret giving me
special treatment later.

00:08:37.517 --> 00:08:40.353
I don't really think
I could dodge it at this range.

00:08:42.272 --> 00:08:43.857
Here you are, Cain.

00:08:44.566 --> 00:08:46.359
Thanks, girlie.

00:08:47.152 --> 00:08:48.278
My name is Chloe.

00:08:48.695 --> 00:08:51.114
Gren, you heard where he's at.

00:08:51.823 --> 00:08:53.241
Give Queenie some backup.

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:54.951
Roger.

00:08:55.869 --> 00:08:57.620
I'll be at the scene ASAP!

00:09:02.292 --> 00:09:03.793
I'm regretting it.

00:09:04.169 --> 00:09:08.381
That kick broke two or three
of my ribs, damn it.

00:09:10.175 --> 00:09:11.217
Give up.

00:09:14.262 --> 00:09:15.513
That's low!

00:09:16.973 --> 00:09:20.143
It's a mere taste of the environment
I was brought up in.

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:24.230
Call it low if you like,
but survival was all that mattered.

00:09:27.609 --> 00:09:31.112
Later, my lady kenpō master.

00:09:36.826 --> 00:09:37.827
Damn it!

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:44.250
She didn't hold back.

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:48.588
Okay, let's go.

00:09:58.431 --> 00:09:59.432
What's that?

00:10:00.517 --> 00:10:02.894
Even from a different angle, it shows up.

00:10:03.728 --> 00:10:04.729
Here, too.

00:10:08.233 --> 00:10:09.526
Something's there.

00:10:09.776 --> 00:10:11.236
But I can't tell what.

00:10:11.778 --> 00:10:13.363
Can we do an infrared analysis?

00:10:13.947 --> 00:10:16.366
Ordinary surveillance cameras
don't have that.

00:10:17.617 --> 00:10:18.827
What's Doug up to?

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:22.580
Let's rethink this from the start.

00:10:27.335 --> 00:10:28.461
Princess!

00:10:30.797 --> 00:10:31.798
Doug...

00:10:32.507 --> 00:10:33.508
He was...

00:10:34.217 --> 00:10:35.885
Don't talk. Lie still!

00:10:37.428 --> 00:10:38.471
Doug...

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:41.141
He was...

00:10:45.311 --> 00:10:46.312
Princess!

00:10:46.396 --> 00:10:47.397
Nurse!

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:48.565
Get the doctor!

00:10:52.861 --> 00:10:53.862
Stop!

00:10:54.445 --> 00:10:56.447
I thought I saw something for a second.

00:10:58.783 --> 00:10:59.909
What is that thing?

00:11:01.536 --> 00:11:02.996
Optical stealth armor?

00:11:03.997 --> 00:11:06.291
BRAI. That confirms it.

00:11:06.708 --> 00:11:07.709
Confirms what?

00:11:08.251 --> 00:11:10.420
Doug was aiming for this guy.

00:11:11.254 --> 00:11:12.964
Do you know his location?

00:11:13.673 --> 00:11:14.757
I'm monitoring him.

00:11:15.466 --> 00:11:17.886
Okay. Time to contact Queenie and Gren.

00:11:21.723 --> 00:11:23.433
Sniping was just the opening act.

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:27.937
The ones really worth killing
get dealt with up close.

00:11:28.396 --> 00:11:30.189
That's how I do things.

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:32.358
Same goes for you, right?

00:11:33.318 --> 00:11:36.112
I'll put an end to this,
for Emilia's sake.

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:47.373
<i>Once upon a time,</i>
<i>there was a foolish young man named Doug.</i>

00:11:49.584 --> 00:11:51.377
<i>This foolish young man</i>

00:11:51.961 --> 00:11:55.798
<i>was ordered to protect</i>
<i>a foolish scientist.</i>

00:11:58.718 --> 00:12:00.470
She is a genius.

00:12:01.137 --> 00:12:03.056
Geniuses are easy to manipulate.

00:12:03.473 --> 00:12:06.142
They're a unique kind of monster,
after all.

00:12:07.477 --> 00:12:11.522
They rush headlong seeking knowledge,
never looking aside.

00:12:11.773 --> 00:12:13.775
What's more, she's got great intuition.

00:12:13.858 --> 00:12:17.862
If we're not careful, she might realize
that the goals of the research

00:12:17.946 --> 00:12:19.864
aren't what she's truly in pursuit of.

00:12:20.031 --> 00:12:21.824
Am I to ensure she doesn't?

00:12:22.867 --> 00:12:23.868
Yes.

00:12:24.786 --> 00:12:25.787
How tasteless.

00:12:26.663 --> 00:12:28.081
She's a woman, you know.

00:12:28.748 --> 00:12:32.669
There's only one way to make sure
you're not betrayed by a woman.

00:13:08.371 --> 00:13:10.415
<i>One day she said to me,</i>

00:13:10.623 --> 00:13:12.333
<i>"I want to analyze</i>

00:13:12.417 --> 00:13:16.129
<i>your unique powers of concentration</i>
<i>and accuracy as a sniper."</i>

00:13:16.671 --> 00:13:18.047
<i>I agreed to help.</i>

00:13:18.589 --> 00:13:23.136
<i>Then my data was input</i>
<i>into the AI she was developing.</i>

00:13:29.017 --> 00:13:31.310
You're that AI from back then.

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:36.024
That's why you
monitor my movement patterns,

00:13:36.441 --> 00:13:39.068
and are too cowardly
to come out of the shadows.

00:13:39.152 --> 00:13:40.319
My shadow!

00:13:55.501 --> 00:13:56.502
Tell me,

00:13:57.336 --> 00:13:59.088
what do daisies symbolize?

00:14:13.352 --> 00:14:17.857
<i>However, her death was faked</i>
<i>to deceive the organization.</i>

00:14:18.691 --> 00:14:21.903
That is to say, it was an act!
A lie. A ruse.

00:14:22.779 --> 00:14:25.073
The two escaped hand in hand.

00:14:26.366 --> 00:14:28.993
Such a beautiful tale of love.

00:14:29.869 --> 00:14:33.456
However, fate was fickle
like the quantum field.

00:14:34.165 --> 00:14:36.501
When they had finally
shaken their pursuers,

00:14:36.751 --> 00:14:39.087
<i>the reactor incident occurred.</i>

00:14:40.088 --> 00:14:43.299
<i>Apparently,</i>
<i>she was killed and eaten by BRAI.</i>

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:50.723
I know.
You've been hiding this whole time!

00:14:55.436 --> 00:14:57.271
Shit! The damn thing's evolving!

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:02.819
I'll be the one to snuff your life out!

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:08.449
The one who recovered the sniper AI,
and installed the Dark Drive

00:15:08.533 --> 00:15:10.451
was none other than myself.

00:15:11.911 --> 00:15:15.498
Don't you like fairy tales, Mr. Gold?

00:15:17.458 --> 00:15:21.462
Putting up with your drivel
is truly taxing.

00:15:22.088 --> 00:15:25.758
So, was the name of that
female scientist perhaps...

00:15:26.092 --> 00:15:30.930
You flatter me.
It was Emilia. Emilia Valli.

00:15:35.935 --> 00:15:38.146
What's the matter, Emilia?

00:15:43.359 --> 00:15:45.528
Leon, I've got a favor!

00:15:46.487 --> 00:15:49.574
If it's a hyperdrive,
I've already installed it.

00:15:50.908 --> 00:15:52.994
It figures you'd know.

00:15:53.494 --> 00:15:54.495
That's right.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.584
This hide and seek is over!

00:16:05.173 --> 00:16:06.424
Take one of these!

00:16:30.364 --> 00:16:31.199
Damn it!

00:16:38.456 --> 00:16:39.624
I'll be the one

00:16:39.999 --> 00:16:41.751
to put an end to you!

00:16:46.297 --> 00:16:47.507
Here goes!

00:16:54.222 --> 00:16:55.431
What the hell?

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:11.906
There are infinite "me's" dying and living
at the same time!

00:17:12.031 --> 00:17:14.033
<i>Those are the outcomes in parallel worlds.</i>

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:16.869
<i>-It's only a matter of probability.</i>
-Is that so?

00:17:18.371 --> 00:17:21.249
So, this is the world you saw!

00:17:21.624 --> 00:17:24.377
A hyperdrive? Why does he get one?

00:17:47.858 --> 00:17:49.277
Here's the BRAI's location.

00:17:49.902 --> 00:17:51.862
You can't shoot it directly from there.

00:17:53.239 --> 00:17:55.741
Who said I was going
to shoot directly at it?

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:10.381
What the...

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:12.842
It curved! How'd he do that?

00:18:13.092 --> 00:18:15.428
He fired rounds
at different muzzle velocities.

00:18:16.554 --> 00:18:18.347
He fired a slower round first,

00:18:18.889 --> 00:18:21.017
then shot that round to change its path.

00:18:21.601 --> 00:18:24.478
There's no way a human
could pull off a feat like that!

00:18:25.062 --> 00:18:29.442
Well, Doug sure can.
With the power of the hyperdrive.

00:18:34.864 --> 00:18:37.742
<i>Move, Doug. It's going to target you.</i>

00:18:40.411 --> 00:18:42.997
I'll decide how this ends.

00:19:03.601 --> 00:19:05.895
When a sniper exposes his position,

00:19:06.437 --> 00:19:10.232
it means he's certain
he can blow away his enemy.

00:19:12.109 --> 00:19:14.820
Your fate was sealed from the start.

00:19:15.988 --> 00:19:17.073
It's over now...

00:19:18.449 --> 00:19:19.450
Emilia...

00:19:20.368 --> 00:19:22.370
<i>-Doug!</i>
<i>-Doug!</i>

00:19:22.578 --> 00:19:24.038
<i>Doug!</i>

00:19:28.334 --> 00:19:29.335
How cute.

00:19:29.627 --> 00:19:30.920
You're keeping it?

00:19:31.253 --> 00:19:33.673
-Can't I?
-It's fine by me, but...

00:19:34.382 --> 00:19:36.008
What will you name it?

00:19:37.051 --> 00:19:38.177
You decide.

00:19:38.719 --> 00:19:39.720
What?

00:19:40.346 --> 00:19:41.347
Doug!

00:19:58.280 --> 00:20:00.783
Emilia...

00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:02.660
It's a side effect!

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:13.921
He's kissing the cat!

00:20:16.424 --> 00:20:17.967
Doug is so cute!

00:20:18.759 --> 00:20:20.636
GOOD FORTUNE

00:20:23.556 --> 00:20:26.308
I see. So, the BRAI was defeated?

00:20:26.726 --> 00:20:28.811
Yes, thanks to Pandora.

00:20:30.438 --> 00:20:33.190
"Nights living in fear of BRAI
are a thing of the past."

00:20:33.774 --> 00:20:35.776
The moment I said that, I was shot.

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:40.865
Though I was prepared for this,
many people will see it as a disgrace.

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:42.241
Princess...

00:20:43.284 --> 00:20:44.618
Some of our citizens...

00:20:45.369 --> 00:20:48.330
may not be satisfied
until they see my blood spilled.

00:20:50.416 --> 00:20:52.418
Are they done questioning you?

00:20:53.043 --> 00:20:54.670
Six months' reduction in wages.

00:20:55.087 --> 00:20:57.548
Guess I won't be visiting
adult shops for a while.

00:20:57.840 --> 00:20:58.924
I see.

00:21:01.302 --> 00:21:04.388
Why didn't you kill me back then?

00:21:08.267 --> 00:21:10.352
We finally get some nice weather,

00:21:10.436 --> 00:21:12.605
and you want to talk about
ancient history?

00:21:14.106 --> 00:21:18.360
I've told you before.
I don't kill anyone not worth killing.

00:21:19.153 --> 00:21:21.614
So, I wasn't even worth killing?

00:23:00.838 --> 00:23:04.550
I'm surprised you came,
with your wounds still fresh.

00:23:05.759 --> 00:23:08.220
I couldn't just ignore your
gracious invitation.

00:23:09.930 --> 00:23:11.473
You must understand now.

00:23:12.057 --> 00:23:15.519
How simple a task
stealing your city would be.

00:23:15.978 --> 00:23:17.855
What a heavy-handed demonstration.

00:23:19.106 --> 00:23:21.900
You only want to see
my blood spilled, right?

00:23:22.359 --> 00:23:23.569
Hot Pot Kim!

00:23:23.944 --> 00:23:26.155
Never call me by that name!

00:23:28.115 --> 00:23:30.409
Cecile, you bitch.

00:23:31.201 --> 00:23:37.791
You'd do well to remember this.
Now I'm known as Mr. Gold!

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:50.471
RED FLAME RECOLLECTION

00:23:50.554 --> 00:23:51.930
Subtitle translation by Amanda Miller
